  "Name": "Batman: Arkham Origins Blackgate Deluxe Edition",
  "Overview": "This deluxe edition is an updated version of Batman: Arkham Origins - Blackgate, adapted from handheld devices. The main content is identical, but there are new maps, enemy encounters, difficulty levels, batsuits, and enhanced visuals. The layout of the levels for instance has been reorganized and now resembles more those of the Metroid Prime games. In addition several character designs were improved along with the graphics to match them more closely to those of Batman: Arkham Origins. Some of the achievements are also different.",
